contentText:
It&#8217;s been more than 10 years since Rihanna&#8217;s last album, ANTI , which has spent over a decade on the Billboard 200, but the Navy is still starving to hear what Rihanna has in store if she does decide to shift the music landscape with some new tunes.

RiRi hosted a TikTok Live for her Fenty Beauty brand on Wednesday (Oct. 7), and while promoting some of her new products, she took a fan question, which asked her to estimate the amount of unreleased songs she has in the vault.

